<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:41:19 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>为已有数十年历史的白血病药物发现新的控制层</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/discovering-a-new-layer-of-control-for-a-decades-old-leukemia-drug</link><description>70 多年来，药物 6-硫鸟嘌呤 (6-TG) 一直用于治疗白血病。尽管其临床效果已被广泛研究，但科学家们仍在揭示决定细胞是否屈服于药物或在其攻击下幸存的分子机制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/discovering-a-new-layer-of-control-for-a-decades-old-leukemia-drug2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/discovering-a-new-layer-of-control-for-a-decades-old-leukemia-drug</guid></item><item><title>前列腺癌：逃避免疫，启发治疗</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/prostate-cancer-evading-immunity-inspiring-therapy</link><description>梅鲁等人。 ESPACE 是一个人类胰腺的单细胞多组学图谱，涵盖胎儿发育、成年期和 2 型糖尿病。结合转录组学、染色质可及性和空间成像，他们发现了罕见的塑料中心泡细胞和产生激素的胰岛细胞之间隐藏的多样性，从而告知胰腺再生和疾病。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/prostate-cancer-evading-immunity-inspiring-therapy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/prostate-cancer-evading-immunity-inspiring-therapy</guid></item><item><title>银河系以外的恒星流提供了绘制暗物质图谱的新工具</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/stellar-stream-beyond-milky-way-offers-new-tool-to-map-dark-matter</link><description>在上图中，可以看到一条微弱的恒星轨迹横跨银河系。这些结构被称为球状星团恒星流，是连贯的恒星结构，保留了其动力学历史的记录，可以为星系的演化和暗物质的性质提供独特的见解。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stellar-stream-beyond-milky-way-offers-new-tool-to-map-dark-matter.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:11:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/stellar-stream-beyond-milky-way-offers-new-tool-to-map-dark-matter</guid></item><item><title>胶质母细胞瘤亚型多样性图谱</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/glioblastoma-isoform-diversity-mapping</link><description>研究人员在脑癌研究方面取得了重大突破，开发了迄今为止最全面的胶质母细胞瘤异构体多样性图谱，胶质母细胞瘤是成人中最常见和最具侵袭性的脑癌形式。利用先进的长读长单细胞测序，研究小组发现了数千种以前未知的肿瘤特异性遗传亚型，而传统方法仍然无法发现这些亚型。这一发现揭示了潜在治疗靶点的新来源，包括可用于未来个性化癌症疫苗和免疫疗法的候选靶点。研究结果发表在《自然通讯》上。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/glioblastoma-isoform-diversity-mapping2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:56:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/glioblastoma-isoform-diversity-mapping</guid></item><item><title>LINGO1 靶向奥匹辛单抗 MMAE ADC 具有抗尤文肉瘤功效，且体内毒性降低</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/lingo1targeted-opicinumabmmae-adcs-show-antiewing-sarcoma-efficacy-with-reduced-toxicity-in-vivo</link><description>生物化学和生物物理学系。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/lingo1targeted-opicinumabmmae-adcs-show-antiewing-sarcoma-efficacy-with-reduced-toxicity-in-vivo2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/lingo1targeted-opicinumabmmae-adcs-show-antiewing-sarcoma-efficacy-with-reduced-toxicity-in-vivo</guid></item><item><title>识别出潜在的语言特定大脑网络</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/potential-language-specific-brain-network-identified</link><description>即使您没有说一句话，您大脑中的语言网络也是可见的。对于发表在&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/potential-language-specific-brain-network-identified2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/potential-language-specific-brain-network-identified</guid></item><item><title>Explainx.ai：免费的个性化人工智能学习、研讨会和训练营</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/explainx-ai-free-personalized-ai-learning-workshops-bootcamps</link><description>为您和您的团队提供免费的个性化 AI 学习：由 AI 导师提供的自适应路径、现场研讨会以及由教过 350,000 多名学生的讲师举办的 20 多个实践训练营。加上使用 AI 构建所需的一切：100k+ 工具、10k+ 代理技能、2k+ MCP 服务器以及 50 多个自定进度课程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/explainx-ai-free-personalized-ai-learning-workshops-bootcamps.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:11:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/explainx-ai-free-personalized-ai-learning-workshops-bootcamps</guid></item><item><title>查看 Ringworld Architect，Godot 制作的基于多米诺骨牌的益智游戏</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/check-out-ringworld-architect-dominobased-puzzle-game-made-in-godot</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:56:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/check-out-ringworld-architect-dominobased-puzzle-game-made-in-godot</guid></item><item><title>机器人已经取代了 5 种危险工作（以及原因）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/5-dangerous-jobs-robots-are-already-replacing-and-why</link><description>了解机器人已经取代的 5 种危险工作，为什么安全和责任推动机器人的采用，以及人类在哪些领域仍然至关重要。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/5-dangerous-jobs-robots-are-already-replacing-and-why.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/5-dangerous-jobs-robots-are-already-replacing-and-why</guid></item><item><title>人工智能正在让日常生活变得更加昂贵，至少目前是这样。这就是为什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-is-making-daily-life-more-expensive-at-least-for-now-heres-why</link><description>事实证明，人工智能的繁荣对于普通美国人来说是很复杂的。它提高了生活成本并阻止美联储降低利率。它使一些事情变得更快、更容易，但它也改变了我们的生活方式。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-is-making-daily-life-more-expensive-at-least-for-now-heres-why.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:26:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-is-making-daily-life-more-expensive-at-least-for-now-heres-why</guid></item></channel></rss>